448	559	2	demo_one_page_proposal_extractor_ready.pdf	application/pdf	44439	f85ba9c3c77fb40b81f1bf45f3491ddf327e27305f0fa3c1e9f4fa6d9329636a	1	\\	Smart Campus FYP Management Assistant\nDemo One-Page Proposal | Extractor Test Document\nTitle: \nSmart Campus FYP Management Assistant\nPurpose: \nTo help students, supervisors, and coordinators manage FYP proposals, feedback, documents, and project progress in\none secure workspace.\nProblem Statement: \nFYP information is often scattered across messages, files, and spreadsheets. Students may miss proposal requirements,\nsupervisors may lose feedback history, and coordinators may lack a clear view of project decisions.\nObjectives: \n1. Centralize proposal submission and supervisor requests. 2. Extract proposal details from uploaded documents. 3.\nCompare titles with authorized previous-project references. 4. Preserve feedback and decision history.\nMethodology: \nThe system uses a role-based web application. Students upload a one-page PDF, the platform extracts required fields,\nchecks the proposal against stored references, and sends a request to the selected supervisor. Supervisors can review\nthe proposal and return feedback or a decision.\nExpected Outcomes: \nA transparent and searchable FYP workflow with faster review, structured documentation, secure role-based access,\nand traceable supervisor feedback.\nKeywords: FYP management, proposal extraction, supervisor allocation, compliance checking, project archive	{"title": {"value": "Smart Campus FYP Management Assistant", "source": "page 1", "display": "Smart Campus FYP Management Assistant", "source_page": 1}, "topic": {"value": null, "source": null, "display": "Not detected in PDF", "source_page": null}, "purpose": {"value": "To help students, supervisors, and coordinators manage FYP proposals, feedback, documents, and project progress in one secure workspace. FYP information is often scattered across messages, files, and spreadsheets. Students may miss proposal r