512	623	1	demo_one_page_proposal_2_smart_library.pdf	application/pdf	44455	3b35fc8b65abc88c0ad6cc75b387b7c2c359e765867c93d40b0a8fcf40872626	1	\\	AI-Assisted Smart Library Recommendation System\nDummy One-Page Proposal | Proposal Extraction Demo 2\nTitle: \nAI-Assisted Smart Library Recommendation System\nPurpose: \nTo help university students discover relevant books, research papers, and digital resources according to their\ncourses, interests, and current research topics.\nProblem Statement: \nStudents often spend significant time searching for useful library resources. Existing searches usually depend on\nexact keywords and may not understand the student's research context or recommend related material.\nObjectives: \n1. Build a searchable digital library catalogue. 2. Recommend relevant resources using topic and keyword\nmatching. 3. Save student search history and useful references. 4. Provide authorized resource access for students\nand supervisors.\nMethodology: \nThe system will collect resource metadata, normalize titles and keywords, and rank results using deterministic\nrelevance rules. A role-based web interface will allow students to search resources while administrators manage\ncatalogue records and access permissions.\nExpected Outcomes: \nA faster and more organized academic resource discovery experience, improved research support for students,\nand a maintainable digital catalogue for university departments.\nKeywords: smart library, academic search, resource recommendation, student research, digital catalogue	{"title": {"value": "AI-Assisted Smart Library Recommendation System", "source": "page 1", "display": "AI-Assisted Smart Library Recommendation System", "source_page": 1}, "topic": {"value": null, "source": null, "display": "Not detected in PDF", "source_page": null}, "purpose": {"value": "To help university students discover relevant books, research papers, and digital resources according to their courses, interests, and current research topic